SUMMARY:Thursday YOGA
DESCRIPTION:It’s finally time to take our yoga practice back to nature! Join us for yoga in the vineyard Grandview for the summer 2026 series. $20 includes 1 hour vinyasa practice and your first beverage of choice. Stay after to enjoy social time with friends! Register on Eventbrite or contact Twisted Fitness for a Venmo option \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/thursday-yoga-4/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/YogaJune.jpg
END:VEVENT
