SUMMARY:Wine Bottle Succulent Workshop at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Grab some friends and join us for a fun evening of getting your hands a little dirty and creating your very own Wine Bottle Succulent Arrangement\, while sipping on amazing wine! Whether you prefer full-bodied and savory reds\, fresh and crisp whites\, or have a sweeter palate\, you’re sure to find a wine you’ll love! \nYour ticket includes the class\, all materials and care instructions. (5 succulents\, wine bottle\, soil\, drainage stones\, decorative elements\, care instructions and best practices for growing succulent to be included in presentation) \nThis workshop is limited to 25 people. Each person must purchase a ticket to participate\, it is not allowed for two people to “share” one ticket. Pre-registration and pre-payment are required to hold your spot. \n*Terms & Conditions-Please note this is NOT a bring your own planter\, succulents or wine to this event. We’ve got all of that covered. Also please note that cancellations will incur a $3.00 processing fee. \n**There is a space inside to use\, so this workshop will be held rain or shine! \nClick Here to Purchase Tickets \n 
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/wine-bottle-succulent-workshop-at-grandview-2/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/winebottlesucculent.webp
END:VEVENT
